{"about_the_game":"Arcanatica is a brand new multiplayer survival action game with elements of magic. <br>The game combines many different mechanics, such as survival, hunting, building, crafting, and others, along with elements of magic.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><li><strong>Choose your hero!</strong><br>You can choose the gender, hairstyle... for your character!<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Play with friends and more!<br>It already contains all the usual elements (kill, steal items from a corpse, etc...).<br></li><li><strong>Fighting</strong><br>with bare hands!<br></li><li><strong>Survival &amp; Magic</strong><br>Health, Mana, Thirst, Hunger, -&gt; Death<br></li><li><strong>Magic</strong></li></ul><br>In order to use magic, you need to have a special stone that contains concentrated magical energy in a certain flow, which will allow you to use the magic stored in this stone.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magic</h2><li><strong>1. Throw a stone</strong><br>This begins the game's evolution, with this magic you will be able to deal remote damage to another player and start mining resources!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942000?t=1741778490","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2942000?t=1741778490","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741778490","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741778490","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Arcanatica is a brand new multiplayer survival action game with elements of magic. <br>The game combines many different mechanics, such as survival, hunting, building, crafting, and others, along with elements of magic.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><li><strong>Choose your hero!</strong><br>You can choose the gender, hairstyle... for your character!<br></li><li><strong>Multiplayer</strong><br>Play with friends and more!<br>It already contains all the usual elements (kill, steal items from a corpse, etc...).<br></li><li><strong>Fighting</strong><br>with bare hands!<br></li><li><strong>Survival &amp; Magic</strong><br>Health, Mana, Thirst, Hunger, -&gt; Death<br></li><li><strong>Magic</strong></li></ul><br>In order to use magic, you need to have a special stone that contains concentrated magical energy in a certain flow, which will allow you to use the magic stored in this stone.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Magic</h2><li><strong>1. Throw a stone</strong><br>This begins the game's evolution, with this magic you will be able to deal remote damage to another player and start mining resources!</li></ul>","developers":["SUDT Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2942000/header.jpg?t=1741778490","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Arcanatica","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 - 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD Ryzen 5 5500<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1650S / AMD Radeon RX 6600<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Ver